# web-design-system

> **Purpose:** Keep the UI consistent with docs/design-system.md.
>
> **Applies to:** Components, pages and styles in `apps/web`.

## Tokens
- Use design tokens only (`--paper`, `--ink`, `--stamp`, and so on). No raw hex values in components.
- Dark mode uses the `.dark` class. Never hard-code a dark colour.
- On a stamp-filled button, text uses `--on-stamp`.

## Typography
- Inter for reading text. JetBrains Mono for scopes, URLs, labels and the stamp.
- Sentence case everywhere.

## Guide page order (fixed)
1. Header: app name, archetype, difficulty dots
2. VerdictStamp
3. Next step and top blocker
4. MilestoneBar
5. StepCards
6. BlockerCards
7. ConflictCards (if any)
8. Sources and verification summary

## Evidence
- Render evidence only through `EvidenceLabel`.
- Every label shows an icon, a word and a colour. Never colour alone.
- Icons: check = Tested, link = Sourced, help-circle = Uncertain (Lucide).

## Layout
- Spacing scale: 4, 8, 12, 16, 24, 32, 48 px.
- Radius 6 px. Content width 880 px max.
- No shadows. Hover raises the border colour only.
